havior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_bug_filing_4527.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_filing_deferred.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_resolver_cap.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_resolver_no_rebar_id_writes.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_resolver.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_parent_sync.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_preflight_status_dict.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_read_latest_status_reducer.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_status_annotation_labels.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_status_preflight.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_status_transition_rest.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_bug_filing_4527.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_filing_deferred.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_resolver_cap.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_resolver_no_rebar_id_writes.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/conflict/test_conflict_resolver.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrin